Interactively pick a label from a filterable list and output its ID.

Designed for command chaining with other paso commands.

Examples:
  # Pick a label and attach it to a task
  paso label attach --task=42 --label=$(paso label pick)

  # Pick from a specific project
  paso label pick 2

Usage:
  paso label pick [project-id] [flags]

Flags:
  -p, --project int   Project ID (uses git branch association if not specified)
